{
  "name": "metaontic-video",
  "version": "3.13.13",
  "description": "AI video creation plugin for DeepSeek Harness: Seedance 2.0 long videos with multi-segment continuation, text-to-video, image-to-video, script and storyboard review, segment previews, resumable generation and local FFmpeg merging.",
  "license": "MIT",
  "type": "module",
  "keywords": [
    "metaontic-video",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "deepseek-harness-plugin",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "ai-video",
    "ai-video-generation",
    "seedance",
    "seedance-2",
    "long-video",
    "video-generation",
    "text-to-video",
    "image-to-video",
    "video-continuation",
    "video-extension",
    "storyboard",
    "ffmpeg",
    "new-api",
    "video-director"
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/wxsimon2022/metaontic-video.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/wxsimon2022/metaontic-video#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/wxsimon2022/metaontic-video/issues"
  },
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "skills",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "logo.svg",
    "README.md",
    "README.en.md",
    "MetaOnticVideo使用说明书.md",
    "MetaOnticVideo使用说明书.pdf",
    "CHANGELOG.md",
    "LICENSE",
    "docs/guide/*.svg",
    "docs/guide/*.png",
    "THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-tool",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-session",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-plugin-manager",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-api-remotes"
      ]
    }
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/node": "^20.19.43",
    "esbuild": "^0.28.2",
    "react": "^19.3.1",
    "react-dom": "^19.3.1",
    "typescript": "^5.9.3",
    "hyperframes": "0.8.223",
    "@deepseek-ai/schemastery": "~3.18.5"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "typecheck": "tsc -p tsconfig.json",
    "build:locale": "node scripts/build.mjs locale",
    "build:host": "node scripts/build.mjs host",
    "build:client": "node scripts/build.mjs client",
    "build": "npm run typecheck && node scripts/build.mjs",
    "preview": "node scripts/preview.mjs",
    "release": "node scripts/release.mjs",
    "clean:releases": "node scripts/clean-releases.mjs",
    "pack:test": "node scripts/pack-test.mjs"
  },
  "dependencies": {},
  "releaseNotes": {
    "version": "3.13.13",
    "prerelease": false,
    "publishedAt": "2026-11-03T10:54:52.809Z",
    "items": [
      "修复：Windows 在线更新反复失败、报 ERR_PNPM_MISSING_TARBALL_INTEGRITY 的问题。安装目录的 pnpm-lock.yaml 里只要留着一条本插件缺少校验值的远程包记录（包括旧版本留下的、已经没人引用的记录），pnpm 就会拒绝整次安装。插件现在按「本插件所有远程记录里哪些拿不到合法校验值」来判断，profile 根目录、下级目录与同级的临时 staging 目录里的锁文件都会检查，检查间隔由 10 秒缩短到 2 秒，坏记录连同依赖声明一起清掉、其他依赖和带校验值的正常记录不动，改前文件另存为 pnpm-lock.yaml.metaontic-backup-时间。",
      "优化：命中上面这条报错时不再直接放弃——更新会等后台清理完成自动重试，用户不用自己数着秒再点一次；仍然失败才提示手动删除锁文件。中英文提示同步改为「每 2 秒自动清理 + 自动重试」。",
      "优化：使用说明书、README 与工程规范同步这次排查结论与处理方式：说明该报错与插件包、操作系统无关，不是 Windows 文件占用问题，先等自动清理与重试，仍失败再完全退出 Harness 删除安装目录下的 pnpm-lock.yaml 后重装；说明书配图与 PDF 已随正文重新导出。"
    ]
  }
}
